	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>Whether by birth, ritual, or accident, you are infused with powers from the &amp;reference[elemental] plane of fire. Magic comes to you easily, and you have greater control over elemental fire than any other.</em></p><table><caption><p>The Fire Savant</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Features</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Empowered Cantrips: <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.2Wh2etRL3SpfI86v]{Fire Bolt}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.gRspPs2vx18Jx5BQ]{Sacred Flame}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.VbLYqCgcsK2lp4ZH]{Wreathing Flames}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.pg5hhRwYakaRS15k]{&amp;reference[elemental] Infusion}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.s9aJ4tBy9P2vDLKQ]{Ascendant Fire}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.Nh8sq9EtMjMjux4F]{Fire &amp;reference[elemental] Form}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption><p>Expanded Spell List</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Sorcerer Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Extra Spells</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.etJoWZwBdvTMuJwh]{Burning Hands}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.sZREhsiZMPrT6xdI]{Heat Metal}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.pbT9cw6nsjpmwrVZ]{Fireball}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.zQ7lBRzId8peTjor]{Wall of Fire}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.qSuF4WJzTahI6hNO]{Flame Strike}</em></p></td></tr></tbody>