				"title": "Ignan Speech",
				"hint": "You learn the primordial language. You can read and write primordial and understand all spoken dialects of primordial. You can also use minor elemental magics to speak like a fire elemental.\n\nYou can create roaring flames and crackling embers from your hands, recreating the sounds a fire elemental makes to speak the Ignan dialect of primordial."
