						"_id": "twRv9qSelkBUOqDD",
						"conditions": "{}",
						"replacement": "",
						"key": "system.description.value",
						"type": "override",
						"value": "<p><em>You invoke the power of the sun, searing your target with light that seeks them out.</em></p><p><strong>[[/save dexterity]]{Dexterity Save}</strong></p><p>Your target cannot benefit from &amp;reference[cover] against this cantrip.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target takes [[/damage 1d10 radiant]] damage.*</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No damage.</p></li></ul><p><strong>*At Higher Levels:</strong> This spell's damage increases by 1d10 when you reach a total character or creature level of 5th level ([[/damage 2d10 radiant]]), 11th level ([[/damage 3d10 radiant]]), and 17th level ([[/damage 4d10 radiant]]).</p>"
